// Hands out MSPAN_META_SLOT_SIZE-byte slots used as mspan-header storage. Three-tier:
//   1. Pop from the intrusive free-list at __slab_meta_free_head if non-null.
//   2. Otherwise bump within the current metadata chunk if it has room.
//   3. Otherwise grab a fresh 8 KiB chunk; reserve its first slot as the result
//      and reseed bump_ptr / bump_end.
