// Reset a span's slot region to "entirely virgin": empty free list, bump cursor at
// the base, every slot available. The caller must guarantee the pages are already
// zero (fresh from the arena, or explicitly memzeroed).
//
// This REPLACES the old __slab_build_freelist, which threaded a next-pointer through
// slot[0] of all N slots. That loop was not just expensive (up to 1024 dependent
// stores touching a whole 8 KiB span); it DIRTIED every slot, and a dirty slot has
// to be memzeroed before it can be handed out. Deleting it is what lets
