// Chunk-aligned physical footprint of a span's slot data: ceil(slotSize *
// totalSlots / 8192) * 8192, matching how __slab_refill_mcache sized the span's
// chunk run (numChunks = ceil(dataSize / 8192), each chunk 8 KiB). Shared by the
// scavenger's decommit and the re-back-on-reuse path so the two always agree on
// exactly how many bytes to hand back / re-commit. `shr 13 / shl 13` is the
// page-align form (8192 == 1 << 13).
function __slab_span_footprint(slotSize MachineWord, totalSlots MachineWord) returns MachineWord
	return ((slotSize * totalSlots + 8191) shr 13) shl 13
