	// sub-byte-packed element_size (< 0) would otherwise size `newCap * (negative)`
	// wrong and every later packed write past byte 0 would corrupt the heap; this
	// grow is on the insert/append path for a mutated packed array (via
	// `ensureCapacity`). Same formula as create / cow_check / slice.
